        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "Uniform Boundedness, are proved. For this reason I contemplated not proving these results here, but in the end decided that they should be proved. I did bring myself to relegate to the appendices the proofs of the representation of the dual of LP (Appendix B) and the dual of "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "C _ { 0 } ( X )"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " (Appendix C)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.124,
          0.175,
