              0.649,
              0.792
            ]
          }
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "Chapter XI, which does not depend on Chapter X, proves the basic properties of the Fredholm index. Though it is possible to do this in the context of unbounded operators between two Banach spaces, this material is presented for bounded operators on a Hilbert space."
          }
        ]
      },
