            "type": "text",
            "content": "There are a few notational oddities. The empty set is denoted by . A reference number such as (8.10) means item number 10 in Section 8 of the present chapter. The reference (IX.8.10) is to (8.10) in Chapter IX. The reference (A.1.1) is to the first item in the first section of Appendix A."
