        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "The most significant difference between this edition and the first is that the last chapter, Fredholm Theory, has been completely rewritten and simplified. The major contribution to this simplification was made by Hari Bercovici who showed me the most simple and elegant development of the Fredholm index I have seen."
